## Overview
A companion concept inspired by Liberty Prime-scale characters. The companion is a giantess who travels with the Sole Survivor and provides unique traversal, combat, and narrative interactions.

## Core Concept
- Giantess companion roughly Liberty Prime size
- Cannot enter buildings or tight interiors
- Uses Liberty Prime’s walk animation set
- Can carry the Sole Survivor like a mobile Vertibird escort

## Abilities
- Stomp attack (AOE damage)
- Throw attack (launch enemies)
- AP-based charge or “Prime-style” step attack
- Possible custom perk tied to her size

## Limitations
- No interior navigation
- Running/jumping animations may require custom assets
- Pathfinding challenges due to scale

## Narrative Hooks
- Origin quest explaining her size
- Optional radio beacon to summon her
- Dialogue system adapted for large-scale NPCs

## Implementation Notes
- Requires F4SE for custom behaviors
- Liberty Prime skeleton as animation base
- Custom meshes and collision needed
